The '''Desecrated Shrine''' is an upcoming instanced [[Fishing Island]], accessible via [[Ship Navigator]] once a currently unknown NPC is recruited into the player's [[Ship Crew]]. One of its notable features will be [[Guardian Slayer]]. 

== Features ==
=== Instance ===
The '''Desecrated Shrine''' was said to be an instanced island, implying a similarity between it, [[The Catacombs]] and [[Kuudra]].
=== Guardian Slayer ===
{{Main|Guardian Slayer}}
The '''Desecrated Shrine''' will feature Guardian Slayer, the first fishing-based slayer boss. It will be spawned by slaying '''Desecrated Shrine'''<nowiki/>'s unique Sea Creatures and its abilities will be tied to the map of the island.
